## Verification Plan

### Automated Tests
```bash
# Trên server sau khi deploy
docker compose up -d --build
docker compose ps                    # Kiểm tra tất cả services running
docker compose logs backend          # Kiểm tra EF Migrate + SeedData OK
curl http://localhost:8080/api/health # Test API health
curl http://localhost:5000            # Test FE
```

### Manual Verification
- SSH vào server, connect vào SQL Server container để chạy SQL scripts
- Test login flow qua https://annam.id.vn
